{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52888","headline":"书诀 · 张怀瓘","name":"书诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"剡纸易墨，心圆管直。\n浆深色浓，万毫齐力。\n先临告誓，次写《黄庭》。\n骨丰肉润，入妙通灵。\n努如直槊，勒若横钉。\n虚专妥帖，殴鬬峥嵘。\n开张凤翼，耸擢芝英。\n粗不爲重，细不爲轻。\n纤微向背，毫发死生。\n工之未尽，已擅时名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张怀瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52888.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52888","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}